cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GDP, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GDP (Geotechnical Data Package)"
abstract: >-
  An open file format for factual geotechnical investigation data (soils):
  CSV tables and TOML files in a zip, with a machine-readable schema,
  a reference validator and a SQLite importer.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
authors:
