  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bteodoru/geotechnical-data-package"
keywords:
  - geotechnical engineering
  - site investigation
  - geotechnical data exchange
  - data format
  - CSV
  - AGS 4
  - DIGGS
